      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"JdbcRepositoryFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.support\"><code>JdbcRepositoryFactory</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalMappingContext</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEventPublisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisher</code></a>.",
