    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> used for looking up <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> and\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/ResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>ResultSetExtractor</code></a> beans.",
